     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I was recently accepted into <span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:12.727272033691406px;line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\">ShinyApps Alpha to deploy my shiny app.  I am having a bit of a hard time with package dependencies.  </span><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:12.727272033691406px;line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\">For the package &#39;ape&#39; (</span><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ape/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ape/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403340884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BKgFOoaI5BDl-r_zBqJrv\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ape/index.html</a></span></font><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:12.727272033691406px;line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\">), I get the following error:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:12.727272033691406px;line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 79025 failed: Error building image: Error fetching ape (3.1-1) source. Error downloading package source: HTTP 404: Not Found</span></font><br></div><div><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\">It seems to be trying to fetch an older version of this package. Is there a way around this?</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.590909004211426px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"line-height:13.5909090